  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.StarknetOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to StarkNet -- STARK-based ZK validity rollup with Cairo VM, offering virtually unlimited scalability, no trusted setup, and Ethereum-level security. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and tokens with cryptographically proven state. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Rebuild Starknet keys and accounts on the official starknet.js SDK (7abd5b3)\n- Select verified Starknet demo release without unqualified TRON adapter (01802b9)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.StarknetOASIS",
